{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 46, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the Land of the Rising Sun a most wondrous quest I shall now weave for thee.\n\n**Day the First Tokyo's Grand Entrance**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth arrive at Narita's gate.\nA taxi swift doth whisk thee hence to Shinjuku's height.\nThere lodging awaits a haven of peace and grace.\nThen wander forth in Shinjuku Gyoen a tranquil place.\nDinner shall be enjoyed in Golden Gai's embrace tiny bars a delightful sight.\n\n**Day the Second Tokyo's Wonders Unfold**\n\nTo Asakusa we fare a temple old and grand.\nSenso-ji's incense doth fill all the land.\nThen Ueno Park a verdant space to roam.\nMuseums abound a cultural home.\nAkihabara's electric town a dazzling show.\nAnime manga and gadgets all aglow.\n\n**Day the Third Hakone's Mountain Majesty**\n\nA journey by train to Hakone's peak we climb.\nMount Fuji's visage a breathtaking chime.\nCruise Lake Ashi serene and calm and blue.\nVolcanic hot springs a restorative view.\nHakone Open-Air Museum art and nature blend.\nA peaceful respite until journey's end.\n\n**Day the Fourth Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nThe Shinkansen's speed doth carry us afar.\nTo Kyoto's realm beneath a guiding star.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion dream.\nThousands of torii a vibrant gleam.\nGion's geishas a fleeting graceful sight.\nA traditional dance in fading light.\n\n**Day the Fifth Kyoto's Temples and Gardens**\n\nKinkaku-ji's Golden Pavilion shines so bright.\nA reflection perfect a dazzling light.\nRyoan-ji's zen garden a mindful art.\nStone and sand a calming restart.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove a whispering sound.\nNature's cathedral on hallowed ground.\n\n**Day the Sixth Nara's Deer and Todai-ji**\n\nTo Nara we journey deer roam free and bold.\nTodai-ji Temple's giant Buddha told.\nGreat bronze statue a sight to behold.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine lanterns bright and old.\nA historical wonder a story to impart.\n\n**Day the Seventh Osaka's Culinary Delights**\n\nTo Osaka we venture a city full of zest.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant test.\nTakoyaki and okonomiyaki flavors divine.\nStreet food delights a culinary shrine.\nOsaka Castle a fortress grand and strong.\nA city of laughter where joy belongs.\n\n**Day the Eighth Farewell Japan**\n\nA final breakfast a bittersweet goodbye.\nTo Japan's beauty beneath the azure sky.\nReturn to Narita for thy homeward flight.\nMemories cherished a wondrous sight.\nUntil we meet again in lands afar.\nFarewell Japan a shining star.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.012519695796072483}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5660643577575684}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.9365425705909729}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.001122797722928226}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.06851240247488022}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.23191198706626892}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.026315078139305115}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -3.099436753473128e-06}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.04133841022849083}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.0916166752576828}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.04466549679636955}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.23499201238155365}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.23619712889194489}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.009056205861270428}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.6905642747879028}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.6934534907341003}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.006038280203938484}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.004104642663151026}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0897991731762886}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0018989879172295332}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -8.22540732769994e-06}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.002502050483599305}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.1742627620697021}, {"token": "▁First", "logprob": -7.986990567587782e-06}, {"token": "▁Tokyo", 